# FormWise AI – Netlify Edge Routing & API Proxy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. API Proxy: Forward all frontend API requests to the hosted Flask backend
# Update YOUR_BACKEND_URL with your hosted backend URL (e.g. https://formwise-ai-api.onrender.com)
/api/*  https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!
/health https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL.onrender.com/health  200!

# 2. Extensionless Routing: Allow navigation without typing .html
/login        /login.html        200
/register     /register.html     200
/dashboard    /dashboard.html    200
/upload       /upload.html       200
/assistant    /assistant.html    200
/profile      /profile.html      200
/preview      /preview.html      200
/validation   /validation.html   200
